nvidia-oot: build for Linux 7.x

Kernel API changes between v6.18 and v7.3 that the modules built here
hit. Each change is gated on the kernel version, so older kernels build
the same code as before.

- conftest: the const 'vm_flags' probe checked for the '__vm_flags' union
  member, which v6.19 renamed to 'flags'. Test the constness of
  'vm_flags' directly, otherwise nvmap and tegra-drm assign to it.
- host1x-fence: v7.1 can embed the fence lock in struct dma_fence; use
  dma_fence_spinlock() instead of fence->lock.
- tegra-drm: v7.2 renamed struct drm_atomic_state to struct
  drm_atomic_commit, and drm_print.h is no longer included indirectly.

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/tegra/drm.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/tegra/drm.c
